        "title": "Understanding FOIL",
        "text": "FOIL stands for First, Outer, Inner, Last. It's a method to multiply two binomials.\n\nFor $(a + b)(c + d)$:\n- First: $a \\times c$\n- Outer: $a \\times d$\n- Inner: $b \\times c$\n- Last: $b \\times d$",
